    'No games match “{query}”': '‮No‬ ‮games‬ ‮match‬ ‮“‬{query}‮”‬',
    Normal: '‮Normal‬',
    'Not added to the record: the far seat changed hands during this match.':
      '‮Not‬ ‮added‬ ‮to‬ ‮the‬ ‮record:‬ ‮the‬ ‮far‬ ‮seat‬ ‮changed‬ ‮hands‬ ‮during‬ ‮this‬ ‮match.‬',
