    'Traffic fills the road ahead, and some of it can be driven round while some of it cannot. Pick your lane, and hop the rest. First taxi across the city wins.':
      '‮Traffic‬ ‮fills‬ ‮the‬ ‮road‬ ‮ahead,‬ ‮and‬ ‮some‬ ‮of‬ ‮it‬ ‮can‬ ‮be‬ ‮driven‬ ‮round‬ ‮while‬ ‮some‬ ‮of‬ ‮it‬ ‮cannot.‬ ‮Pick‬ ‮your‬ ‮lane,‬ ‮and‬ ‮hop‬ ‮the‬ ‮rest.‬ ‮First‬ ‮taxi‬ ‮across‬ ‮the‬ ‮city‬ ‮wins.‬',
